    "body": "Review findings addressed in d8a9d4d: Bore/Tap/BackBore past the flute pass when the shank fits the hole (else refused by name), holder still checked; the cross holder is judged per Z band (a stepped shaft's far flange no longer refuses; the flange under the holder still does); an off-centre cross hole measures reach from where a wider shank meets the raw bar (r20, offset 15, Ø3 on Ø6, 9 mm flute: refused at 9.744 mm); non-finite holder fields refused by name; degenerate facets and vertical walls no longer set a false top; the 47 -> 38 mm comment. New tests failed first: drill_reach (+2), drill_reach_fit (3), 3 unit tests. Suites: drill_reach 6, drill_reach_fit 3, drilling_* all, face_holes, posting, operations, blind_floor, solid_law, golden_cl, conformance, verify, lib - green; clippy clean.",
